<%--
Sidebar_Kpi_Group - the "At a Glance" grid of compact KPI cells

default content - <Kpi_Cell> cells

Sits at the TOP of a Detail_Sidebar (KPIs are sidebar telemetry, not a
top-of-page billboard). Lays its cells out in a compact two-up grid.

Usage:
    <Sidebar_Kpi_Group>
        <Kpi_Cell ...>...</Kpi_Cell>
        <Kpi_Cell ...>...</Kpi_Cell>
    </Sidebar_Kpi_Group>
--%>
<Define:Sidebar_Kpi_Group>
    <%= content() %>
</Define:Sidebar_Kpi_Group>
